(5912780, 861720, 40391, '<td valign="top">Very nice! A few photos so far with the same theme (ie water drops on mirror finish). This is, however, one of the better ones as far as composition, focus, exposure etc. What pushes it above the rest is the subtle capture of the droplet crown. A fav &amp; 9 from me - good luck!</td>', 'Very nice! A few photos so far with the same theme (ie water drops on mirror finish). This is, however, one of the better ones as far as composition, focus, exposure etc. What pushes it above the rest is the subtle capture of the droplet crown. A fav & 9 from me - good luck!', '2010-03-22 05:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
