(5912862, 862167, 63633, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but is that selective desaturation? Looks strange how the inside/right of the car is blue/greenish, and the  rest of the shot looks almost grayscale.</td>', 'Nice shot, but is that selective desaturation? Looks strange how the inside/right of the car is blue/greenish, and the  rest of the shot looks almost grayscale.', '2010-03-22 06:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5912863, 861544, 63633, '<td valign="top">Great setup and brilliant lighting on the chocolate. The lighting doesn''t work so well on the fruit though (looks a little dull).</td>', 'Great setup and brilliant lighting on the chocolate. The lighting doesn''t work so well on the fruit though (looks a little dull).', '2010-03-22 06:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5912866, 861729, 63633, '<td valign="top">You have done really well on the lighting and colours here. They compliment the product perfectly. I also like how you have made the product small in the frame rather than zooming in a bit. Makes it all seem a bit more feminine and delicate.<br/> <br/>I would have liked to see a sharper focus on the wording on the bottle. Really detracts in my opinion.</td>', 'You have done really well on the lighting and colours here. They compliment the product perfectly. I also like how you have made the product small in the frame rather than zooming in a bit. Makes it all seem a bit more feminine and delicate. I would have liked to see a sharper focus on the wording on the bottle. Really detracts in my opinion.', '2010-03-22 06:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5912867, 862220, 63633, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and focus. A tad more contrast would have been better though I think.</td>', 'Great lighting and focus. A tad more contrast would have been better though I think.', '2010-03-22 06:54:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5912887, 862049, 63633, '<td valign="top">Best of the challenge by far. 9.</td>', 'Best of the challenge by far. 9.', '2010-03-22 07:16:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5912888, 861720, 63633, '<td valign="top">Sharpness, color and contrast are all spot-on. A lot of attention must have gone into those reflections!<br/>Nice use of the water drop to add interest (hope you don''t get slaughtered in voting because of it!).<br/> <br/>Not 100% convinced by the composition of this shot. Had the potential to be a blue ribbon, but I put it equal second - 8.<br/> <br/>I''m probably wrong, but I''m going to guess that this is Oliver''s.</td>', 'Sharpness, color and contrast are all spot-on. A lot of attention must have gone into those reflections!Nice use of the water drop to add interest (hope you don''t get slaughtered in voting because of it!). Not 100% convinced by the composition of this shot. Had the potential to be a blue ribbon, but I put it equal second - 8. I''m probably wrong, but I''m going to guess that this is Oliver''s.', '2010-03-22 07:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5912890, 862085, 63633, '<td valign="top">Really great sharpness.  I thought that one of the other shots in the challenge was Oliver''s (h2), but this would work really really well as a stock image, so maybe this one is his.<br/> <br/>Really good job - bumping to 8.</td>', 'Really great sharpness.  I thought that one of the other shots in the challenge was Oliver''s (h2), but this would work really really well as a stock image, so maybe this one is his. Really good job - bumping to 8.', '2010-03-22 07:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5912891, 862112, 63633, '<td valign="top">Really stunning shot. Lighting is excellent and focus is good. My equal pick for the red. 8.</td>', 'Really stunning shot. Lighting is excellent and focus is good. My equal pick for the red. 8.', '2010-03-22 07:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5912892, 861755, 63633, '<td valign="top">Really really great lighting. I''m just not taken with the composition of the shot. I feel like two subjects were not necessary, and you should have just stuck to the skull. Also the subjects looked cramped in the frame. More space around them would have been good I think.<br/> <br/>Having said that, it would have been a very hard decision for me to crop out the glass, because it looks so fantastic :)</td>', 'Really really great lighting. I''m just not taken with the composition of the shot. I feel like two subjects were not necessary, and you should have just stuck to the skull. Also the subjects looked cramped in the frame. More space around them would have been good I think. Having said that, it would have been a very hard decision for me to crop out the glass, because it looks so fantastic :)', '2010-03-22 07:16:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5912893, 862207, 63633, '<td valign="top">Nice work. Is that a model in the foreground and a real outdoor scene in the background? Very effective.</td>', 'Nice work. Is that a model in the foreground and a real outdoor scene in the background? Very effective.', '2010-03-22 07:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
