(5913226, 862169, 52336, '<td valign="top">Holy beautiful... like a pop art dream.  Something I''d expect to see hanging in a gallery.  Excellently composed, perfectly processed, eye-popping goodness.  Nice. 8</td>', 'Holy beautiful... like a pop art dream.  Something I''d expect to see hanging in a gallery.  Excellently composed, perfectly processed, eye-popping goodness.  Nice. 8', '2010-03-22 12:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
