(5914688, 861944, 44877, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent image - edgy and arty. However, I don''t feel it fits the challenge too well as I don''t believe a photo like this would be in a catalog - though I may be wrong. At least I''ve never seen it. I won''t vote. Still love the image.</td>', 'This is an excellent image - edgy and arty. However, I don''t feel it fits the challenge too well as I don''t believe a photo like this would be in a catalog - though I may be wrong. At least I''ve never seen it. I won''t vote. Still love the image.', '2010-03-23 18:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5914690, 861845, 44877, '<td valign="top">I really like this. It''s well composed and executed. The title is pithy. It''s totally appealing to the eye - and therefore meets the challenge wonderfully.</td>', 'I really like this. It''s well composed and executed. The title is pithy. It''s totally appealing to the eye - and therefore meets the challenge wonderfully.', '2010-03-23 18:09:46.000000', NULL, 1),
