(5914709, 861755, 91496, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I like the stark constast in the scene and how you lit the glass.  Might be a little tight to the frame on the bottom.</td>', 'Very nice.  I like the stark constast in the scene and how you lit the glass.  Might be a little tight to the frame on the bottom.', '2010-03-23 18:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
