(5915645, 861800, 61961, '<td valign="top">Nice color, okay clarity, though oddly the product and setting don''t look cold, they just look wet (perhaps after the thaw).  Based on your title, I''ll guess that the product is sitting on ice, but without it I wouldn''t have guessed "cold."</td>', 'Nice color, okay clarity, though oddly the product and setting don''t look cold, they just look wet (perhaps after the thaw).  Based on your title, I''ll guess that the product is sitting on ice, but without it I wouldn''t have guessed "cold."', '2010-03-24 09:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5915774, 862191, 67152, '<td valign="top">Back for a comment and a bump.  i like your choice of set up and composition with the sea in the background, but the image seems to suffer from some significant chromatic abberation issues and overall the tone seems ''too blue'' as if the cyan and blue saturation was tweaked too much.</td>', 'Back for a comment and a bump.  i like your choice of set up and composition with the sea in the background, but the image seems to suffer from some significant chromatic abberation issues and overall the tone seems ''too blue'' as if the cyan and blue saturation was tweaked too much.', '2010-03-24 11:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5915903, 862217, 12796, '<td valign="top">is your product the glass or the beverage in the bottle (or rather bottle as a brand). I am a taker if your product is actually the glass. For the rest, I would definitely say you should have showed us the bottle in full. Please note that buyers can actually claim that the product received is not as per the details shown. LOL.<br/> <br/>Good shot anyways.</td>', 'is your product the glass or the beverage in the bottle (or rather bottle as a brand). I am a taker if your product is actually the glass. For the rest, I would definitely say you should have showed us the bottle in full. Please note that buyers can actually claim that the product received is not as per the details shown. LOL. Good shot anyways.', '2010-03-24 12:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5915906, 861853, 12796, '<td valign="top">seems slightly out of focus.</td>', 'seems slightly out of focus.', '2010-03-24 12:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
