(5915974, 862180, 115618, '<td valign="top">LOVE IT!!!!!</td>', 'LOVE IT!!!!!', '2010-03-24 13:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5916035, 861887, 5364, '<td valign="top">As you''ve effectively asked for comments (is it working?) here''s mine.<br/> <br/>I''m not voting because I''m in this challenge, but I think I would have given you a 6. I like the "quality" of the image - i.e. it''s in focus and exposed well, and more importantly I like the composition with the strong diagonals. As a "product" shot I''m not so sure about it. I feel that all the fragments make it look very messy so I don''t think it sends the right message because of that.<br/> <br/>Hope this is the sort of comment you''re looking for.</td>', 'As you''ve effectively asked for comments (is it working?) here''s mine. I''m not voting because I''m in this challenge, but I think I would have given you a 6. I like the "quality" of the image - i.e. it''s in focus and exposed well, and more importantly I like the composition with the strong diagonals. As a "product" shot I''m not so sure about it. I feel that all the fragments make it look very messy so I don''t think it sends the right message because of that. Hope this is the sort of comment you''re looking for.', '2010-03-24 13:42:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5916045, 861659, 5364, '<td valign="top">As you''ve effectively asked for comments (is it working?) here''s mine.<br/> <br/>I''m not voting because I''m in this challenge, but I think I would have given you a 5. It certainly fits the challenge. I like the composition and you''ve handled the exposure well. My major problem is that it doesn''t look upright to me and I''m also not liking the wings being slightly out of focus.<br/> <br/>Hope this is the sort of comment you''re looking for.</td>', 'As you''ve effectively asked for comments (is it working?) here''s mine. I''m not voting because I''m in this challenge, but I think I would have given you a 5. It certainly fits the challenge. I like the composition and you''ve handled the exposure well. My major problem is that it doesn''t look upright to me and I''m also not liking the wings being slightly out of focus. Hope this is the sort of comment you''re looking for.', '2010-03-24 13:48:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5916054, 862205, 5364, '<td valign="top">As you''ve effectively asked for comments (is it working?) here''s mine.<br/> <br/>I''m not voting because I''m in this challenge, but I think I would have given you a 5. I like your subject and you''ve photographed them well, but I think the composition lets it down. I feel you might have been better separating the cars more and having them facing diagonally across the image - that way you would have the large area of negative space at the top.<br/> <br/>Hope this is the sort of comment you''re looking for.</td>', 'As you''ve effectively asked for comments (is it working?) here''s mine. I''m not voting because I''m in this challenge, but I think I would have given you a 5. I like your subject and you''ve photographed them well, but I think the composition lets it down. I feel you might have been better separating the cars more and having them facing diagonally across the image - that way you would have the large area of negative space at the top. Hope this is the sort of comment you''re looking for.', '2010-03-24 13:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5916342, 862087, 61961, '<td valign="top">A little dark, but looks delicious.  Is there a tiny tilt correction needed, or is that an optical illusion?  Hard to tell with some objects.  To me this gives the impression of sitting in front of a fireplace.</td>', 'A little dark, but looks delicious.  Is there a tiny tilt correction needed, or is that an optical illusion?  Hard to tell with some objects.  To me this gives the impression of sitting in front of a fireplace.', '2010-03-24 17:29:09.000000', NULL, 1),
