(5916584, 862205, 112861, '<td valign="top">The "shadows" are very sharp/jagged. However, the colors are nice and bright.</td>', 'The "shadows" are very sharp/jagged. However, the colors are nice and bright.', '2010-03-24 19:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5916586, 860875, 113278, '<td valign="top">For me the white balance seems off and you have a yellow tint to the whole shot. Also it is very cluttered with a very busy background. And is that an ashtray front and center? There is also a lot of dirt/dust on the table. Maybe you were very intentional about all this but when I look at it I see a shot that wasn''t really thought through with some easy fixes that were missed.</td>', 'For me the white balance seems off and you have a yellow tint to the whole shot. Also it is very cluttered with a very busy background. And is that an ashtray front and center? There is also a lot of dirt/dust on the table. Maybe you were very intentional about all this but when I look at it I see a shot that wasn''t really thought through with some easy fixes that were missed.', '2010-03-24 19:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5916588, 862195, 112861, '<td valign="top">Too forbidden for me to partake of. The glittering "seed pod" is very ingenious, however. (Bump)</td>', 'Too forbidden for me to partake of. The glittering "seed pod" is very ingenious, however. (Bump)', '2010-03-24 19:11:19.000000', NULL, 1),
