(5916594, 861874, 112861, '<td valign="top">More salt, please.</td>', 'More salt, please.', '2010-03-24 19:12:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5916595, 861800, 113278, '<td valign="top">I like this shot and my only nit pick is that the top off the can seems a bit oof, large aperture?</td>', 'I like this shot and my only nit pick is that the top off the can seems a bit oof, large aperture?', '2010-03-24 19:12:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5916626, 862183, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like your choice of the shallow DOF but for a true product shot, I think they''d want just a bit deeper with more of the product in focus.  Very good even lighting.  (Commenting only.)</td>', 'I like your choice of the shallow DOF but for a true product shot, I think they''d want just a bit deeper with more of the product in focus.  Very good even lighting.  (Commenting only.)', '2010-03-24 19:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5916630, 862115, 30982, '<td valign="top">The blur looks added in post - whether that''s the case or not, it looks that way, and it can be a bit disconcerting.  I do like the idea of real daffodils in place used as the ad!  (Commenting only.)</td>', 'The blur looks added in post - whether that''s the case or not, it looks that way, and it can be a bit disconcerting.  I do like the idea of real daffodils in place used as the ad!  (Commenting only.)', '2010-03-24 19:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5916632, 862176, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nice product shot - good graphic design.  (Commenting only.)</td>', 'Very nice product shot - good graphic design.  (Commenting only.)', '2010-03-24 19:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5916634, 862145, 30982, '<td valign="top">Simple, clean product shot.  Light is very good.  (Commenting only.)</td>', 'Simple, clean product shot.  Light is very good.  (Commenting only.)', '2010-03-24 19:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5916635, 862213, 30982, '<td valign="top">The water drops and reflection are good standards to spice up product shots - cute use of the woody, too.  My only suggestion would be a brighter background color.  (Commenting only.)</td>', 'The water drops and reflection are good standards to spice up product shots - cute use of the woody, too.  My only suggestion would be a brighter background color.  (Commenting only.)', '2010-03-24 19:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5916638, 861842, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice colour in the car. I can see some cloning in the upper left, though, that looks very sloppy.</td>', 'Nice colour in the car. I can see some cloning in the upper left, though, that looks very sloppy.', '2010-03-24 19:48:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5916639, 862218, 30982, '<td valign="top">LOL!  Not sure what the message is, really, but love the shot.  The look is priceless - and those SO not used to scrubbing pristine pink hands...  My only suggestion is you need to have the product in very crisp focus for most of the ad folks.  (Commenting only.)</td>', 'LOL!  Not sure what the message is, really, but love the shot.  The look is priceless - and those SO not used to scrubbing pristine pink hands...  My only suggestion is you need to have the product in very crisp focus for most of the ad folks.  (Commenting only.)', '2010-03-24 19:48:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5916644, 862215, 30982, '<td valign="top">An interesting product to showcase!  The shot feels a bit overexposed and lacking contrast, but the diagonals provide a good strong basis.  (Commenting only.)</td>', 'An interesting product to showcase!  The shot feels a bit overexposed and lacking contrast, but the diagonals provide a good strong basis.  (Commenting only.)', '2010-03-24 19:49:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5916646, 862084, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice graphic setup!  Good clean background, good product placement.  (Commenting only.)</td>', 'Nice graphic setup!  Good clean background, good product placement.  (Commenting only.)', '2010-03-24 19:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5916648, 862205, 30982, '<td valign="top">Has a nice nostalgic feel to it but the products (the cars) probably need to be much crisper as far as focus.  (Commenting only.)</td>', 'Has a nice nostalgic feel to it but the products (the cars) probably need to be much crisper as far as focus.  (Commenting only.)', '2010-03-24 19:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5916649, 862209, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very good use of the product to serve as its own ad.  (Commenting only.)</td>', 'Very good use of the product to serve as its own ad.  (Commenting only.)', '2010-03-24 19:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5916651, 862184, 30982, '<td valign="top">A bit busy but nicely displayed.  Would be one of those pages that then has letters or numbers next to each item so it could be identified and purchased.  (Commenting only.)</td>', 'A bit busy but nicely displayed.  Would be one of those pages that then has letters or numbers next to each item so it could be identified and purchased.  (Commenting only.)', '2010-03-24 19:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5916652, 862088, 30982, '<td valign="top">Good geometrics in this, though it may imply one is better than the other in some strange way.  (Commenting only.)</td>', 'Good geometrics in this, though it may imply one is better than the other in some strange way.  (Commenting only.)', '2010-03-24 19:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5916653, 862000, 49865, '<td valign="top">very nice, curious to know how you did the text! -7-</td>', 'very nice, curious to know how you did the text! -7-', '2010-03-24 19:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5916654, 861934, 30982, '<td valign="top">Excellent layout and very good use of shallow DOF.  I like the grain.  Very realistic as a magazine ad.  Should do very well in voting.  (Commenting only.)</td>', 'Excellent layout and very good use of shallow DOF.  I like the grain.  Very realistic as a magazine ad.  Should do very well in voting.  (Commenting only.)', '2010-03-24 19:53:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5916658, 861729, 30982, '<td valign="top">Simple and clean, with the nice hint of color adding a sense of softness - keeps with that dream/heavenly theme.  Probably just what the ad folks are looking for!   (Commenting only.)</td>', 'Simple and clean, with the nice hint of color adding a sense of softness - keeps with that dream/heavenly theme.  Probably just what the ad folks are looking for!   (Commenting only.)', '2010-03-24 19:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
