(5916667, 861933, 114995, '<td valign="top">Excellent job!  It is absolutely a brilliant idea and you executed it perfectly!!!  10!!!!</td>', 'Excellent job!  It is absolutely a brilliant idea and you executed it perfectly!!!  10!!!!', '2010-03-24 19:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5916673, 861817, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice light, good showing of the product.  My only suggestion would be to show the whole wood block, maybe.  Not sure, but it seems a bit incomplete this way.  (Commenting only.)</td>', 'Nice light, good showing of the product.  My only suggestion would be to show the whole wood block, maybe.  Not sure, but it seems a bit incomplete this way.  (Commenting only.)', '2010-03-24 20:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5916674, 861974, 30982, '<td valign="top">Simple and clean - the slight lean on the right one is somewhat endearing but others may see it as a fault.  (Commenting only.)</td>', 'Simple and clean - the slight lean on the right one is somewhat endearing but others may see it as a fault.  (Commenting only.)', '2010-03-24 20:04:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5916675, 862154, 30982, '<td valign="top">Looks good!  (Commenting only.)</td>', 'Looks good!  (Commenting only.)', '2010-03-24 20:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5916676, 862091, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice approach and very good lighting for the inside of a fridge.  (Commenting only.)</td>', 'Nice approach and very good lighting for the inside of a fridge.  (Commenting only.)', '2010-03-24 20:05:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5916678, 862206, 30982, '<td valign="top">Ha!  Saw the title and wondered what the heck BS stood for.  Poor dog stuck cleaning the bathroom... when she''s done there...  :-)  Cute! (Commenting only.)</td>', 'Ha!  Saw the title and wondered what the heck BS stood for.  Poor dog stuck cleaning the bathroom... when she''s done there...  :-)  Cute! (Commenting only.)', '2010-03-24 20:07:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5916679, 861933, 30982, '<td valign="top">Now THAT is very impressive!!  You ought to send this to the company.  (Commenting only.)</td>', 'Now THAT is very impressive!!  You ought to send this to the company.  (Commenting only.)', '2010-03-24 20:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5916814, 861842, 104841, '<td valign="top">I like the angle you shot the car from. I feel that you have pushed the post processing too far. In particular the tight blur you have done on the back ground is too strong and not even, also it leaves a sharp edge on the car from the mask border.</td>', 'I like the angle you shot the car from. I feel that you have pushed the post processing too far. In particular the tight blur you have done on the back ground is too strong and not even, also it leaves a sharp edge on the car from the mask border.', '2010-03-24 23:01:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5916817, 861748, 7560, '<td valign="top">The key challenge with this shot is focus. As in what is the focus. I''ve got multiple items that could be the focus. Remember the goal is to convey your focus without title. Things you could do to improve: shift the glass to the foreground, reduce additional table clutter. Use DOF (depth of field) to blur out the background in order to force me to focus on the shot.</td>', 'The key challenge with this shot is focus. As in what is the focus. I''ve got multiple items that could be the focus. Remember the goal is to convey your focus without title. Things you could do to improve: shift the glass to the foreground, reduce additional table clutter. Use DOF (depth of field) to blur out the background in order to force me to focus on the shot.', '2010-03-24 23:07:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5916848, 862039, 23098, '<td valign="top">A neat image. Excellent detail and lighting.  (not voting)</td>', 'A neat image. Excellent detail and lighting.  (not voting)', '2010-03-24 23:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5916859, 861933, 15511, '<td valign="top">That''s creative and well taken.</td>', 'That''s creative and well taken.', '2010-03-25 00:01:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5916876, 862202, 15511, '<td valign="top">I can''t resist, number 6.</td>', 'I can''t resist, number 6.', '2010-03-25 00:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5917032, 861659, 28427, '<td valign="top">Ah, another CW code :-)<br/>You''ve well exposed your subject.  Details are nice and clear.  Good job :-)</td>', 'Ah, another CW code :-)You''ve well exposed your subject.  Details are nice and clear.  Good job :-)', '2010-03-25 08:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5917037, 861876, 28427, '<td valign="top">Hmmm - Must be yummie... Pitty it doesn''t exist in our country; at least I never saw it in the shops.  Great compo as well as lighting.  Just maybe a bit more detail on the edges of the glass by using a black reflecting pannel aside the glass *8*</td>', 'Hmmm - Must be yummie... Pitty it doesn''t exist in our country; at least I never saw it in the shops.  Great compo as well as lighting.  Just maybe a bit more detail on the edges of the glass by using a black reflecting pannel aside the glass *8*', '2010-03-25 08:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5917038, 861544, 28427, '<td valign="top">I spontaneously start drooling at the look of these nice strawberries, juicy kiwi and the 70% :)</td>', 'I spontaneously start drooling at the look of these nice strawberries, juicy kiwi and the 70% :)', '2010-03-25 08:18:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5917059, 861933, 7560, '<td valign="top">Extra points for the effort involved in chopping up all those veggies. :) 7</td>', 'Extra points for the effort involved in chopping up all those veggies. :) 7', '2010-03-25 09:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5917075, 862176, 23098, '<td valign="top">Good dof and detail. Nice product shot.  (commenting only)</td>', 'Good dof and detail. Nice product shot.  (commenting only)', '2010-03-25 09:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5917076, 861403, 30982, '<td valign="top">Bold and colorful!  For a product shot, one might want them out of the wrappers - would help negate the reflection problem for one thing.  (Commenting only.)</td>', 'Bold and colorful!  For a product shot, one might want them out of the wrappers - would help negate the reflection problem for one thing.  (Commenting only.)', '2010-03-25 09:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5917078, 861748, 30982, '<td valign="top">A bit busy - one cannot tell what the product being offered is, unless you''re offering a bowl of soup and a beer in a pub.  Also, you need to use the full size available to you - you can go up to 800 pixels on the long side per the rules.  When you go to the submit page to enter a challenge, look on the left and there is a summary of the rules and a link to more information.  (Commenting only.)</td>', 'A bit busy - one cannot tell what the product being offered is, unless you''re offering a bowl of soup and a beer in a pub.  Also, you need to use the full size available to you - you can go up to 800 pixels on the long side per the rules.  When you go to the submit page to enter a challenge, look on the left and there is a summary of the rules and a link to more information.  (Commenting only.)', '2010-03-25 09:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5917079, 862034, 30982, '<td valign="top">Other than being a fun thing to try, I''m not sure I see why advertising wine using paint swatches makes sense.  Also, you need to crisp-up your focus a bit.  (Commenting only.)</td>', 'Other than being a fun thing to try, I''m not sure I see why advertising wine using paint swatches makes sense.  Also, you need to crisp-up your focus a bit.  (Commenting only.)', '2010-03-25 09:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5917081, 862037, 30982, '<td valign="top">Is there really such a beer?  Ballsy name.  Centered works if cropped more tightly, unless you''re leaving room for text.  Needs a bit of curves/contrast, and just a wee bit sharper on the product.  (Commenting only.)</td>', 'Is there really such a beer?  Ballsy name.  Centered works if cropped more tightly, unless you''re leaving room for text.  Needs a bit of curves/contrast, and just a wee bit sharper on the product.  (Commenting only.)', '2010-03-25 09:53:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5917082, 862099, 30982, '<td valign="top">Clean, crisp, good presentation and the chocolates look yummy!  Top quality work.  (Commenting only.)</td>', 'Clean, crisp, good presentation and the chocolates look yummy!  Top quality work.  (Commenting only.)', '2010-03-25 09:54:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5917083, 861936, 30982, '<td valign="top">A little gory and messy... but funny.  (Commenting only.)</td>', 'A little gory and messy... but funny.  (Commenting only.)', '2010-03-25 09:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5917084, 861386, 30982, '<td valign="top">Good clear shot of the product but your photo is too small.  On the left side of the page you use to submit to challenges is a summary of the rules, and a link to more information.  One of those says you can use up to 800 pixels on the long side (horizontal here) of your photo.  Use that - you want to make sure everyone can see your submission clearly!  (Commenting only.)</td>', 'Good clear shot of the product but your photo is too small.  On the left side of the page you use to submit to challenges is a summary of the rules, and a link to more information.  One of those says you can use up to 800 pixels on the long side (horizontal here) of your photo.  Use that - you want to make sure everyone can see your submission clearly!  (Commenting only.)', '2010-03-25 09:55:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5917086, 861718, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice vignetting to isolate your product.  Not sure what the foreground bit is, but you probably don''t need that for a product shot.  (Commenting only.)</td>', 'Nice vignetting to isolate your product.  Not sure what the foreground bit is, but you probably don''t need that for a product shot.  (Commenting only.)', '2010-03-25 09:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5917087, 862048, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice bit of the star flare!  The whole product needs to be in clear, crisp focus for a product shot, and in "the real world" you''d negate all reflections, either via use of a light tent or post processing.  (Commenting only.)</td>', 'Nice bit of the star flare!  The whole product needs to be in clear, crisp focus for a product shot, and in "the real world" you''d negate all reflections, either via use of a light tent or post processing.  (Commenting only.)', '2010-03-25 09:58:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5917088, 861845, 30982, '<td valign="top">And it''s darn good ice cream, too.  Very nicely done!  (Commenting only.)</td>', 'And it''s darn good ice cream, too.  Very nicely done!  (Commenting only.)', '2010-03-25 09:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5917106, 861720, 28427, '<td valign="top">This is a photograph wich is complete and perfect from beginning till the end *10*</td>', 'This is a photograph wich is complete and perfect from beginning till the end *10*', '2010-03-25 10:18:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5917113, 861748, 28427, '<td valign="top">I would have removed the salt and pepper, some slight rearangement of the products on the table.  Also I would have opted for a freashly tapped glass in stead of one were the collar is gone.  Slightly straighten the photograph so that the bar and the table don''t slide away to the left and finally a larger file to upload.  I like the idea of your setup and with a bit more effort this could have been a great photograph.</td>', 'I would have removed the salt and pepper, some slight rearangement of the products on the table.  Also I would have opted for a freashly tapped glass in stead of one were the collar is gone.  Slightly straighten the photograph so that the bar and the table don''t slide away to the left and finally a larger file to upload.  I like the idea of your setup and with a bit more effort this could have been a great photograph.', '2010-03-25 10:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5917135, 862091, 115100, '<td valign="top">nice</td>', 'nice', '2010-03-25 11:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
