(5917561, 861082, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very good product shot - nice tight crop with even black background would allow copy/ad editors to add space if needed.  Good even light.  I like the cool reflection in the lens but I''m not sure if the ad guys would like that or not.  They can always replace it pretty easily if needed.  While it looks pretty sharp, it does look as though it could use one more round of sharpening, perhaps.  Good work!  (Commenting only.)</td>', 'Very good product shot - nice tight crop with even black background would allow copy/ad editors to add space if needed.  Good even light.  I like the cool reflection in the lens but I''m not sure if the ad guys would like that or not.  They can always replace it pretty easily if needed.  While it looks pretty sharp, it does look as though it could use one more round of sharpening, perhaps.  Good work!  (Commenting only.)', '2010-03-25 19:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
