(5917856, 861718, 112828, '<td valign="top">John went to visit his 90 year old grandfather<br/>in a very secluded, rural area of Saskatchewan<br/> <br/>After spending a great evening chatting the night away,<br/>the next morning John''s grandfather prepared<br/>breakfast of bacon, eggs and toast. <br/> <br/>However, John noticed a film like substance on his plate,<br/>and questioned his grandfather asking,<br/> <br/>''Are these plates clean?''<br/> <br/>His grandfather replied,<br/> <br/>''They''re as clean as cool water can get em.<br/>Just you go ahead and finish your meal, Sonny!''<br/> <br/>For lunch the old man made hamburgers.<br/> <br/>Again, John was concerned about the plates,<br/>as his appeared to have tiny specks around<br/>the edge that looked like dried egg and asked,<br/> <br/>''Are you sure these plates are clean?''<br/> <br/>Without looking up the old man said,<br/> <br/>''I told you before, Sonny, those dishes are as<br/>clean as cool water can get them. Now don''t you<br/>fret, I don''t want to hear another word about it!''<br/> <br/>Later that afternoon, John was on his way to a nearby town<br/>and as he was leaving, his grandfather''s dog<br/>started to growl, and wouldn''t let him pass.<br/> <br/>John yelled and said, <br/>''Grandfather, your dog won''t let me get to my car''.<br/> <br/>Without diverting his attention from the football game<br/>he was watching on TV, the old man shouted!<br/> <br/>''Coolwater, GO . LAY . DOWN''</td>', 'John went to visit his 90 year old grandfatherin a very secluded, rural area of Saskatchewan After spending a great evening chatting the night away,the next morning John''s grandfather preparedbreakfast of bacon, eggs and toast.  However, John noticed a film like substance on his plate,and questioned his grandfather asking, ''Are these plates clean?'' His grandfather replied, ''They''re as clean as cool water can get em.Just you go ahead and finish your meal, Sonny!'' For lunch the old man made hamburgers. Again, John was concerned about the plates,as his appeared to have tiny specks aroundthe edge that looked like dried egg and asked, ''Are you sure these plates are clean?'' Without looking up the old man said, ''I told you before, Sonny, those dishes are asclean as cool water can get them. Now don''t youfret, I don''t want to hear another word about it!'' Later that afternoon, John was on his way to a nearby townand as he was leaving, his grandfather''s dogstarted to growl, and wouldn''t let him pass. John yelled and said, ''Grandfather, your dog won''t let me get to my car''. Without diverting his attention from the football gamehe was watching on TV, the old man shouted! ''Coolwater, GO . LAY . DOWN''', '2010-03-26 03:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
