(5918281, 861541, 47974, '<td valign="top">Love the concept but think the DOF is a bit to shallow as part of the cup is not in focus.</td>', 'Love the concept but think the DOF is a bit to shallow as part of the cup is not in focus.', '2010-03-26 13:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
