(5918592, 862039, 104230, '<td valign="top">An excellent catalog shot. I like the slight reflections. They help anchor the object without shifting the focus of the shot away from the watch itself. There is just one thing that bothers me ever so slightly.  There seems to be an area of gray to the left of the watch that I find a bit distracting. (Commenting only)</td>', 'An excellent catalog shot. I like the slight reflections. They help anchor the object without shifting the focus of the shot away from the watch itself. There is just one thing that bothers me ever so slightly.  There seems to be an area of gray to the left of the watch that I find a bit distracting. (Commenting only)', '2010-03-26 18:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918625, 861403, 113411, '<td valign="top">I love this! The colors, the composition, the simplicity. It works</td>', 'I love this! The colors, the composition, the simplicity. It works', '2010-03-26 20:00:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918627, 861934, 97733, '<td valign="top">Very good. Love the way the color brings your eye to the product name immediately.</td>', 'Very good. Love the way the color brings your eye to the product name immediately.', '2010-03-26 20:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918639, 860959, 113411, '<td valign="top">This is fabulous! The color, composition and textures really work. Well done.</td>', 'This is fabulous! The color, composition and textures really work. Well done.', '2010-03-26 20:24:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918642, 861865, 113411, '<td valign="top">Fabulous capture! I love the color, composition and wonderful movement. Really well done.</td>', 'Fabulous capture! I love the color, composition and wonderful movement. Really well done.', '2010-03-26 20:26:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918644, 862187, 113411, '<td valign="top">This is a fabulous composition. I love the detail, color and texture. Really well done.</td>', 'This is a fabulous composition. I love the detail, color and texture. Really well done.', '2010-03-26 20:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918645, 862209, 113411, '<td valign="top">This works! Great color, composition and detail. Well done!</td>', 'This works! Great color, composition and detail. Well done!', '2010-03-26 20:28:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918646, 861876, 113411, '<td valign="top">I love this! Great color, composition and wit! Well done.</td>', 'I love this! Great color, composition and wit! Well done.', '2010-03-26 20:29:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918648, 861724, 113411, '<td valign="top">Great color and composition and wit! Well done.</td>', 'Great color and composition and wit! Well done.', '2010-03-26 20:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918651, 861974, 113411, '<td valign="top">I love this! Great color, line and and composition. Simplicity takes it.</td>', 'I love this! Great color, line and and composition. Simplicity takes it.', '2010-03-26 20:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918652, 861791, 113411, '<td valign="top">M''m really great classic! Well done!</td>', 'M''m really great classic! Well done!', '2010-03-26 20:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918667, 862206, 114752, '<td valign="top">Not sure what you are trying to  say here</td>', 'Not sure what you are trying to  say here', '2010-03-26 21:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918668, 861408, 114752, '<td valign="top">This looks like a professional add. Except for the black sapce at the bottom.</td>', 'This looks like a professional add. Except for the black sapce at the bottom.', '2010-03-26 21:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918670, 862200, 114752, '<td valign="top">What is your product? The flowers, the vase,or the arrangement</td>', 'What is your product? The flowers, the vase,or the arrangement', '2010-03-26 21:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918679, 861653, 47470, '<td valign="top">Product shots are usually characterized by very "clean" shots.  This is not as clean as I would have liked.  The main light is too hard and casts distracting shadows on the background.  The texture of the background is also distracting (check any magazine--the backgrounds rarely have texture).  The exposure between the ambient light and the screen is pretty well done, but I would have exposed the screen just a little longer so that the "white" part of the screen would actually be white.  Then you could bring down the "blacks" of the screen in post-processing.</td>', 'Product shots are usually characterized by very "clean" shots.  This is not as clean as I would have liked.  The main light is too hard and casts distracting shadows on the background.  The texture of the background is also distracting (check any magazine--the backgrounds rarely have texture).  The exposure between the ambient light and the screen is pretty well done, but I would have exposed the screen just a little longer so that the "white" part of the screen would actually be white.  Then you could bring down the "blacks" of the screen in post-processing.', '2010-03-26 21:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918688, 861800, 47470, '<td valign="top">I''m not exactly sure what this product is.  It might be easier for me to figure it out if I saw a little more of one of the sides too instead of an almost straight-on shot.</td>', 'I''m not exactly sure what this product is.  It might be easier for me to figure it out if I saw a little more of one of the sides too instead of an almost straight-on shot.', '2010-03-26 21:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918693, 862167, 47470, '<td valign="top">Nice light on the outside of the car.  I''m not so sure about the blue inside : )  I don''t know if this would have been feasible, but almost all car ads have a wet ground.  That creates a reflection of the car, which makes the image a bit catchier.  I think that if you added water to the ground, it would have made this pop!</td>', 'Nice light on the outside of the car.  I''m not so sure about the blue inside : )  I don''t know if this would have been feasible, but almost all car ads have a wet ground.  That creates a reflection of the car, which makes the image a bit catchier.  I think that if you added water to the ground, it would have made this pop!', '2010-03-26 21:38:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918695, 862183, 47470, '<td valign="top">...big clumps of makeup don''t look very "natural."<br/>Makeup is supposed to be sexy and chique.  The makeup doesn''t look very attractive in this photo.</td>', '...big clumps of makeup don''t look very "natural."Makeup is supposed to be sexy and chique.  The makeup doesn''t look very attractive in this photo.', '2010-03-26 21:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918698, 861645, 47470, '<td valign="top">The black of the candy wrapper blends into the background.  If you added some light from behind to create an outline of the candy, that wouldn''t be a problem.  It would also make the candy glow.  They also usually backlight aliens, so it would totally work ; )</td>', 'The black of the candy wrapper blends into the background.  If you added some light from behind to create an outline of the candy, that wouldn''t be a problem.  It would also make the candy glow.  They also usually backlight aliens, so it would totally work ; )', '2010-03-26 21:44:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918701, 862180, 47470, '<td valign="top">I wish I could see the entire bottle.</td>', 'I wish I could see the entire bottle.', '2010-03-26 21:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918710, 862148, 47470, '<td valign="top">The bottles are tilting to the right.  I don''t think it''s a good idea to make the audience feel drunk even before the buy a bottle : )<br/> <br/>I also think the background is distracting and out of place.  Either a clean sweep background or a wooden bar or pub table would have been more appropriate.</td>', 'The bottles are tilting to the right.  I don''t think it''s a good idea to make the audience feel drunk even before the buy a bottle : ) I also think the background is distracting and out of place.  Either a clean sweep background or a wooden bar or pub table would have been more appropriate.', '2010-03-26 22:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918727, 861791, 7560, '<td valign="top">A classic product shot. Clear, nice detail, and easy to understand. The question I keep asking is could this be done in a more creative manner? Don''t get me wrong, it more than meets the challenge. Solid 7.</td>', 'A classic product shot. Clear, nice detail, and easy to understand. The question I keep asking is could this be done in a more creative manner? Don''t get me wrong, it more than meets the challenge. Solid 7.', '2010-03-26 22:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918729, 861755, 7560, '<td valign="top">Dramatic, well lit, and tells a story. Perfect. 10.</td>', 'Dramatic, well lit, and tells a story. Perfect. 10.', '2010-03-26 22:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918730, 860945, 7560, '<td valign="top">Creative, great lighting. 10</td>', 'Creative, great lighting. 10', '2010-03-26 22:29:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918741, 861870, 115307, '<td valign="top">I think for this to really be a product shot, the whole image should have been in focus. 5</td>', 'I think for this to really be a product shot, the whole image should have been in focus. 5', '2010-03-26 22:39:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918744, 861933, 115307, '<td valign="top">Brilliant! This goes to show that one must look at all images close up :-) This is not noticeable in thumb form. I am super impressed, and I hope it ribbons. 10</td>', 'Brilliant! This goes to show that one must look at all images close up :-) This is not noticeable in thumb form. I am super impressed, and I hope it ribbons. 10', '2010-03-26 22:45:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918745, 862143, 115307, '<td valign="top">There is a ton of dust/speckly stuff in here. I would have clones that out, it makes it seem less clean.</td>', 'There is a ton of dust/speckly stuff in here. I would have clones that out, it makes it seem less clean.', '2010-03-26 22:46:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918747, 861541, 115307, '<td valign="top">A larger aperture that would result in the cup being more in focus would benefit this photo I think. However, I do like the overall image, the colors, and the mood.</td>', 'A larger aperture that would result in the cup being more in focus would benefit this photo I think. However, I do like the overall image, the colors, and the mood.', '2010-03-26 22:47:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918750, 862048, 115307, '<td valign="top">Appears too soft for a product in a catalog.</td>', 'Appears too soft for a product in a catalog.', '2010-03-26 22:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918751, 861659, 115307, '<td valign="top">I own this! :-)<br/>There is not much wrong with this image, however, it needs something to stand out from the crowd. The plain white background with mediocrely lit piece is kind of boring. It needs a "wow" factor that would compel voters to go for those 7s 8s 9s and 10s. A 5 from me.</td>', 'I own this! :-)There is not much wrong with this image, however, it needs something to stand out from the crowd. The plain white background with mediocrely lit piece is kind of boring. It needs a "wow" factor that would compel voters to go for those 7s 8s 9s and 10s. A 5 from me.', '2010-03-26 22:54:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918752, 862193, 115307, '<td valign="top">Since this is a product shot, the whole thing should be in focus. However, the bottom quarter isn''t, and that really detracts for me, especially as it is done with seemingly no purpose. 5</td>', 'Since this is a product shot, the whole thing should be in focus. However, the bottom quarter isn''t, and that really detracts for me, especially as it is done with seemingly no purpose. 5', '2010-03-26 22:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918753, 862116, 115307, '<td valign="top">I find this to be slightly boring with mediocre lighting<br/>But....Can''t......resist....Wall-e....<br/>Must...score...more...highly...than previously intended.</td>', 'I find this to be slightly boring with mediocre lightingBut....Can''t......resist....Wall-e....Must...score...more...highly...than previously intended.', '2010-03-26 22:58:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918757, 862000, 47470, '<td valign="top">Somehow those wrinkles work for this!  Very clean.  Sets a great mood.</td>', 'Somehow those wrinkles work for this!  Very clean.  Sets a great mood.', '2010-03-26 23:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918760, 862203, 47470, '<td valign="top">It looks like the two foremost babies and her feet are out of focus.  I wish the focus had pulled all the way through.  Otherwise, nice and simple, which works perfectly!</td>', 'It looks like the two foremost babies and her feet are out of focus.  I wish the focus had pulled all the way through.  Otherwise, nice and simple, which works perfectly!', '2010-03-26 23:07:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918761, 862218, 47470, '<td valign="top">The light on his face looks very dull.  The dishwasher is also the brightest thing in the photo when it should be the Comet.  Adding a rim light to the Comet might make it stand out better, but I would also put a little more light on the front.  This is a good idea, but I think it would have been better received with some better lighting.</td>', 'The light on his face looks very dull.  The dishwasher is also the brightest thing in the photo when it should be the Comet.  Adding a rim light to the Comet might make it stand out better, but I would also put a little more light on the front.  This is a good idea, but I think it would have been better received with some better lighting.', '2010-03-26 23:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918762, 862048, 47470, '<td valign="top">The highlights on the large stone are too blown out, which loses too much detail in the most important part of the ring.  It''s a delicate balance.</td>', 'The highlights on the large stone are too blown out, which loses too much detail in the most important part of the ring.  It''s a delicate balance.', '2010-03-26 23:11:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918763, 861406, 47470, '<td valign="top">Looks very appetizing!  I would have preferred to see a steak sauce bottle in the back instead of wine.  I don''t think wine fits the "Omaha Steak" brand.  Otherwise, this is a wonderful food shot!</td>', 'Looks very appetizing!  I would have preferred to see a steak sauce bottle in the back instead of wine.  I don''t think wine fits the "Omaha Steak" brand.  Otherwise, this is a wonderful food shot!', '2010-03-26 23:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918764, 862122, 47470, '<td valign="top">I wish there was a slightly deeper depth of field.  The very front of the candle is just going out of focus, which is bad because that''s where the brand name is!</td>', 'I wish there was a slightly deeper depth of field.  The very front of the candle is just going out of focus, which is bad because that''s where the brand name is!', '2010-03-26 23:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918765, 862213, 114225, '<td valign="top">Really enjoy the use of visual metaphor (if that''s the correct term). Not sure how I feel about the water, but that didn''t stop me from voting this high.</td>', 'Really enjoy the use of visual metaphor (if that''s the correct term). Not sure how I feel about the water, but that didn''t stop me from voting this high.', '2010-03-26 23:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918766, 861720, 47470, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  I wish the water drop was a tiny bit sharper--it was difficult to tell what it was at first.</td>', 'Beautiful!  I wish the water drop was a tiny bit sharper--it was difficult to tell what it was at first.', '2010-03-26 23:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918768, 861755, 47470, '<td valign="top">Very clean!  The only thing I would have removed is the writing on the skull, but, of course, it''s hard to say whether or not the SC would deem that a large part of the photo.  In product photography, they never leave that in though.</td>', 'Very clean!  The only thing I would have removed is the writing on the skull, but, of course, it''s hard to say whether or not the SC would deem that a large part of the photo.  In product photography, they never leave that in though.', '2010-03-26 23:17:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918769, 861729, 47470, '<td valign="top">Very pretty and clean.  The mood definitely fits the product.<br/> <br/>Two tiny little nit-picks:<br/>I would have removed the stem from the bottle.  I know it is part of the product, but it seems out of place.  A lot of ads remove the stems to make the bottles look cleaner.<br/>In product photography, it is very important to get the color perfectly accurate.  I love the colors of the background, but I suspect that the stuff inside the bottle is white, not pink or blue, and that that color comes from the background.<br/> <br/>I''m not voting you down on either of these things, but I thought I would mention it anyway : )</td>', 'Very pretty and clean.  The mood definitely fits the product. Two tiny little nit-picks:I would have removed the stem from the bottle.  I know it is part of the product, but it seems out of place.  A lot of ads remove the stems to make the bottles look cleaner.In product photography, it is very important to get the color perfectly accurate.  I love the colors of the background, but I suspect that the stuff inside the bottle is white, not pink or blue, and that that color comes from the background. I''m not voting you down on either of these things, but I thought I would mention it anyway : )', '2010-03-26 23:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918770, 861946, 47470, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous light on the glass!  My only nit-pick is that the top of the bottle blends into the background.  Add a small rim light/back light and problem solved : )</td>', 'Gorgeous light on the glass!  My only nit-pick is that the top of the bottle blends into the background.  Add a small rim light/back light and problem solved : )', '2010-03-26 23:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918771, 861645, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great shot. I could see the candy bar falling in front of Mars in a TV commercial.</td>', 'Great shot. I could see the candy bar falling in front of Mars in a TV commercial.', '2010-03-26 23:17:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918772, 861913, 47470, '<td valign="top">Fun idea.  The detail is slightly overwhelming, but the pattern of the pots help.</td>', 'Fun idea.  The detail is slightly overwhelming, but the pattern of the pots help.', '2010-03-26 23:18:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918773, 862219, 47470, '<td valign="top">Very nice set-up, colors, and processing.  It all gives a great mood to the image.  The only little changes I would make are to straighten the horizon line and to move the candle so it doesn''t look like the napkin is about to catch fire : )</td>', 'Very nice set-up, colors, and processing.  It all gives a great mood to the image.  The only little changes I would make are to straighten the horizon line and to move the candle so it doesn''t look like the napkin is about to catch fire : )', '2010-03-26 23:19:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918774, 861933, 47470, '<td valign="top">I can definitely see this in a magazine ad.  Great gob!  I might whiten the whites a bit more, but otherwise this is very well done.</td>', 'I can definitely see this in a magazine ad.  Great gob!  I might whiten the whites a bit more, but otherwise this is very well done.', '2010-03-26 23:19:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918775, 861943, 47470, '<td valign="top">Wonderful idea!  You could have put a few more reflectors around the jewelry (not to light them more, but to create more catch lights in the stones) to make this even better.</td>', 'Wonderful idea!  You could have put a few more reflectors around the jewelry (not to light them more, but to create more catch lights in the stones) to make this even better.', '2010-03-26 23:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918776, 862088, 47470, '<td valign="top">I think it''s weird to see the stem inside one bottle, but not both.  Personally, I prefer without the stem because it looks cleaner.</td>', 'I think it''s weird to see the stem inside one bottle, but not both.  Personally, I prefer without the stem because it looks cleaner.', '2010-03-26 23:19:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918777, 861791, 47470, '<td valign="top">Ha!  Love it!  I might have desaturated the blues a bit so that the silver of the can would be a bit more neutral.  I''m not voting you down for that though!  Maybe a little oversharpened?</td>', 'Ha!  Love it!  I might have desaturated the blues a bit so that the silver of the can would be a bit more neutral.  I''m not voting you down for that though!  Maybe a little oversharpened?', '2010-03-26 23:19:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918778, 861523, 47470, '<td valign="top">Do the number marks glow in the dark?  Maybe you should have done a long exposure, setting off a strobe, then leaving the shutter open to expose the number marks just long enough to give them a little color and a hint of glow.  Just a suggestion, of course!</td>', 'Do the number marks glow in the dark?  Maybe you should have done a long exposure, setting off a strobe, then leaving the shutter open to expose the number marks just long enough to give them a little color and a hint of glow.  Just a suggestion, of course!', '2010-03-26 23:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918780, 861937, 47470, '<td valign="top">I wish there was a light back light/rim light to help separate the product from the background.  That type of light will also appeal more to the tech people.</td>', 'I wish there was a light back light/rim light to help separate the product from the background.  That type of light will also appeal more to the tech people.', '2010-03-26 23:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918781, 862176, 47470, '<td valign="top">This maybe sound nit-picky, but if this were shot for a company, it could lose you the job.  The reason why the clock hands are usually placed on the three and the ten is because the hands shouldn''t cover the brand name.  Omega would not be happy if they were paying you and their name was covered up!  Just saying : )  Very nice shot otherwise.</td>', 'This maybe sound nit-picky, but if this were shot for a company, it could lose you the job.  The reason why the clock hands are usually placed on the three and the ten is because the hands shouldn''t cover the brand name.  Omega would not be happy if they were paying you and their name was covered up!  Just saying : )  Very nice shot otherwise.', '2010-03-26 23:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918782, 862099, 47470, '<td valign="top">The light on the chocolate is perfect, but the reds in the flower are blown.</td>', 'The light on the chocolate is perfect, but the reds in the flower are blown.', '2010-03-26 23:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918783, 862053, 47470, '<td valign="top">You should brush on some oil or melted butter on top so the food will have some highlights.  Highlights make food look tasty.</td>', 'You should brush on some oil or melted butter on top so the food will have some highlights.  Highlights make food look tasty.', '2010-03-26 23:26:15.000000', NULL, 1),
