(5919483, 862122, 7560, '<td valign="top">You''ve got part of the concept in product shot down. You''ve got a clear, in focus shot focusing on the product. Remember that a product shot is doing a couple things. Most critically it''s selling the product via a story. Now that story can be told with dramatic lighting and production techniques or with choices in props and background. <br/> <br/>With what you have showing, props and background would be part of the story. I''d start by moving back a bit from the product. Possibly reframe things to the left or right. You are so close that I can see every imperfection in the candle. Which isn''t what I want in being sold. :) I like the blue color in the background, but the pattern provides additional distraction. Maybe shift things around a bit so you can''t see the pattern?</td>', 'You''ve got part of the concept in product shot down. You''ve got a clear, in focus shot focusing on the product. Remember that a product shot is doing a couple things. Most critically it''s selling the product via a story. Now that story can be told with dramatic lighting and production techniques or with choices in props and background.  With what you have showing, props and background would be part of the story. I''d start by moving back a bit from the product. Possibly reframe things to the left or right. You are so close that I can see every imperfection in the candle. Which isn''t what I want in being sold. :) I like the blue color in the background, but the pattern provides additional distraction. Maybe shift things around a bit so you can''t see the pattern?', '2010-03-27 23:27:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5919531, 862134, 30982, '<td valign="top">This either speaks to the utter futility of spring cleaning, or the magic and mysteries of arachnid silk.  (Commenting only.)</td>', 'This either speaks to the utter futility of spring cleaning, or the magic and mysteries of arachnid silk.  (Commenting only.)', '2010-03-28 03:22:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5919532, 862179, 30982, '<td valign="top">The armless mummy, once very nicely preserved, is beginning to suffer from oxidation.  A sad but inevitable tale.  (Commenting only.)</td>', 'The armless mummy, once very nicely preserved, is beginning to suffer from oxidation.  A sad but inevitable tale.  (Commenting only.)', '2010-03-28 03:23:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5919533, 862187, 30982, '<td valign="top">I''m going to loosely interpret the French as "may the force be with you" though I do indeed realize that is not what it says.  Yet that IS what the picture says, with the light saber losing in this particular battle to the oxidized mini-pebbles who are quite adeptly holding their own.  (Commenting only.)</td>', 'I''m going to loosely interpret the French as "may the force be with you" though I do indeed realize that is not what it says.  Yet that IS what the picture says, with the light saber losing in this particular battle to the oxidized mini-pebbles who are quite adeptly holding their own.  (Commenting only.)', '2010-03-28 03:27:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5919534, 861966, 30982, '<td valign="top">What people do not realize is that this is not an ad for the ring, or even an abstract, but for that single perfect pearl of air.  Those are priceless, you know.  (Commenting only.)</td>', 'What people do not realize is that this is not an ad for the ring, or even an abstract, but for that single perfect pearl of air.  Those are priceless, you know.  (Commenting only.)', '2010-03-28 03:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5919536, 861545, 30982, '<td valign="top">A rather amazing compilation of senses.  Believe it or not, you''ve got taste in this one - it makes me want Chinese food.  (Commenting only.)</td>', 'A rather amazing compilation of senses.  Believe it or not, you''ve got taste in this one - it makes me want Chinese food.  (Commenting only.)', '2010-03-28 03:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
