(5921059, 860875, 66709, '<td valign="top">very very picking! <br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by jminso:</b></div><hr/><i> For me the white balance seems off and you have a yellow tint to the whole shot. Also it is very cluttered with a very busy background. And is that an ashtray front and center? There is also a lot of dirt/dust on the table. Maybe you were very intentional about all this but when I look at it I see a shot that wasn''t really thought through with some easy fixes that were missed. </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'very very picking!  Originally posted by jminso: For me the white balance seems off and you have a yellow tint to the whole shot. Also it is very cluttered with a very busy background. And is that an ashtray front and center? There is also a lot of dirt/dust on the table. Maybe you were very intentional about all this but when I look at it I see a shot that wasn''t really thought through with some easy fixes that were missed. ', '2010-03-29 11:51:16.000000', NULL, 0),
