(5922395, 861397, 12796, '<td valign="top">couple of things which you could have improved IMHO:<br/>you could have avoided the obtrusive deep orange border. maybe black 1 pxl would have been much better<br/>this is one of the typical issues of using a macro lens, that in fairly large number of cases, the entire frame will not be in focus even if the entire sensor content is in a single plane. It would have been better if you had actually focused on the ball rather than the grass on the front left and right sides.<br/>Hope it helps</td>', 'couple of things which you could have improved IMHO:you could have avoided the obtrusive deep orange border. maybe black 1 pxl would have been much betterthis is one of the typical issues of using a macro lens, that in fairly large number of cases, the entire frame will not be in focus even if the entire sensor content is in a single plane. It would have been better if you had actually focused on the ball rather than the grass on the front left and right sides.Hope it helps', '2010-03-30 15:43:18.000000', NULL, 0),
