(5924743, 862112, 106543, '<td valign="top"><b>Greetings from the Critique Club! </b> <br/> <br/>First jewelry shot?? This looks very professional! And you placed 10th with a 6.766 so obviously the other voters also thought that this was great. I like that you included the Swarovski box in it, shows that it is a real product.<br/> <br/>The only problem I have with your photo is that it seems a bit cluttered. With the box, bracelet, rocks and water it''s just a little too much. And that water that is hook shaped in the top right corner is distracting.<br/> <br/>Overall you did a great job, there were a lot of high scoring images in this contest so making it into the top 10 is quite the accomplishment.<br/> <br/> <br/>If you have any questions <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/messaging.php?action=compose&amp;USER_ID=106543" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">click here to message me</a>! <br/> <br/>Senay</td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club!   First jewelry shot?? This looks very professional! And you placed 10th with a 6.766 so obviously the other voters also thought that this was great. I like that you included the Swarovski box in it, shows that it is a real product. The only problem I have with your photo is that it seems a bit cluttered. With the box, bracelet, rocks and water it''s just a little too much. And that water that is hook shaped in the top right corner is distracting. Overall you did a great job, there were a lot of high scoring images in this contest so making it into the top 10 is quite the accomplishment.  If you have any questions click here to message me!  Senay', '2010-04-01 04:07:00.000000', NULL, 0),
