(6096134, 861791, 23317, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by vawendy:</b></div><hr/><i> Love the story! Love the shot!<br/> <br/>However, did you know that in my old 1920''s dictionary, potatoe is listed as an alternate spelling? I actually remember in school being told that it was an alternate spelling :) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I did not know that.  That''s pretty funny.  Dan''s people should have protested a little more.  Although it probably wouldn''t have helped.</td>', 'Originally posted by vawendy: Love the story! Love the shot! However, did you know that in my old 1920''s dictionary, potatoe is listed as an alternate spelling? I actually remember in school being told that it was an alternate spelling :)   I did not know that.  That''s pretty funny.  Dan''s people should have protested a little more.  Although it probably wouldn''t have helped.', '2010-07-18 12:28:34.000000', NULL, 0),
